{
  "name": "@zhang/dsh-sticky-note",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "DSH 便签：左侧栏入口 + 四列便签板（暂存 / 待办 / 已办 / 临时废弃），黄色便签卡两列排布、可跨列拖动、双击看详情、悬停删除；另有可选的全界面悬浮球，点开可翻看四列便签，可直接在面板里新建便签，也能点铅笔编辑已有便签。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.2"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar"
      ]
    }
  }
}